{"id":"n87745-1-11","stage":4,"title":"훔치다 · 拭去","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87745-1-11-1","ko":"제가 저녁 준비를 도울게요.","zh":"让我来帮忙准备晚餐吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"저녁","meaning":"晚饭，晚餐","explanation":"저녁：晚饭，晚餐。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"2","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}},{"text":"준비를","meaning":"准备","explanation":"준비：准备；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"준비","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86434","senseId":"1","lemma":"준비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"준비를","audio":"/audio/414d053ad46f03aaeac7.mp3"}},{"text":"도울게요.","meaning":"帮，帮助","explanation":"돕다：帮，帮助；을게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"돕다","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17203","senseId":"1","lemma":"돕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도울게요","audio":"/audio/3314a80d55f26e300364.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"晚饭，晚餐","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"晚上吃的饭。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"9ce364fc9c6f2a1c","term":"준비","zh":"准备","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3","entryId":"86434","definition":"事先筹备。","pronunciation":["준ː비"]},{"id":"7feaaecf170e0c6a","term":"돕다","zh":"帮，帮助","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3","entryId":"17203","definition":"给别人正在做的事打下手或添帮手。","pronunciation":["돕ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b1f6008a99c4d2e46a76.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87745-1-11-2","ko":"그럼 식탁을 행주로 훔치고 상을 차리렴.","zh":"那你就用抹布擦擦桌子，然后把餐具摆好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"식탁을","meaning":"餐桌","explanation":"식탁：餐桌；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"식탁","audio":"/audio/54440e480486cc26718c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26869","senseId":"1","lemma":"식탁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식탁을","audio":"/audio/2759149a311dd13923e6.mp3"}},{"text":"행주로","meaning":"抹布，搌布","explanation":"행주：抹布，搌布；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"행주","audio":"/audio/d53199588ca2b7ce49c0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85702","senseId":"1","lemma":"행주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"행주로","audio":"/audio/b11f075cf59075a479bb.mp3"}},{"text":"훔치고","meaning":"拭去，擦去","explanation":"훔치다：拭去，擦去；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"훔치다","audio":"/audio/e7f0ceb36466c81e3510.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87745","senseId":"1","lemma":"훔치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"훔치고","audio":"/audio/42f4201ab5e1f2dd4b24.mp3"}},{"text":"상을","meaning":"桌，席","explanation":"상：桌，席；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"상","audio":"/audio/3c2d6ddb4a94f1f36375.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16444","senseId":"2","lemma":"상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상을","audio":"/audio/8a9533d1c73ef1cf459c.mp3"}},{"text":"차리렴.","meaning":"摆，置办","explanation":"차리다：摆，置办；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"차리다","audio":"/audio/9678982197